{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you relish the immersive feeling of &quot;taking on the entire world alone,&quot; are obsessed with &quot;the surprises and challenges brought by randomness,&quot; or simply yearn for the pure thrill of &quot;beating the game with just one life,&quot; then &quot;Pixel Survival&quot; is tailor-made for you. Here, there are no teammates to rely on, no repetitive levels\u2014only death after death. Death is the end, but also another beginning. And you\u2014you are your own hero.<br><br><strong>&quot;</strong>Pixel Rampage<strong>&quot;\u200b</strong>\u200b is a survival shooter infused with roguelike elements. Players will explore procedurally generated post-apocalyptic cities, collect \u200b<strong>15+ upgradable weapons</strong>\u200b (including grenade launchers and rocket launchers), and battle \u200b<strong>20 mutated bosses</strong>. Each upgrade unlocks new talents, ensuring no progress is ever wasted. The game features an \u200b<strong>endless challenge mode</strong>\u200b and supports \u200b<strong>Steam Achievements &amp; Cloud Saves</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3882840?t=1753836635","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3882840?t=1753836635","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882840/c057690861e2f6236b07be1a64b0ddb7637b2499/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753836635","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882840/c057690861e2f6236b07be1a64b0ddb7637b2499/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753836635","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you relish the immersive feeling of &quot;taking on the entire world alone,&quot; are obsessed with &quot;the surprises and challenges brought by randomness,&quot; or simply yearn for the pure thrill of &quot;beating the game with just one life,&quot; then &quot;Pixel Survival&quot; is tailor-made for you. Here, there are no teammates to rely on, no repetitive levels\u2014only death after death. Death is the end, but also another beginning. And you\u2014you are your own hero.<br><br><strong>&quot;</strong>Pixel Rampage<strong>&quot;\u200b</strong>\u200b is a survival shooter infused with roguelike elements. Players will explore procedurally generated post-apocalyptic cities, collect \u200b<strong>15+ upgradable weapons</strong>\u200b (including grenade launchers and rocket launchers), and battle \u200b<strong>20 mutated bosses</strong>. Each upgrade unlocks new talents, ensuring no progress is ever wasted. The game features an \u200b<strong>endless challenge mode</strong>\u200b and supports \u200b<strong>Steam Achievements &amp; Cloud Saves</strong>.</p>","developers":["MarZou"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882840/d19f57d76fc5e4f15cd4e75f441dffd44ef24d50/header.jpg?t=1753836635","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3882840/633083526/387bda4f00f64ff4766f7609180d4b85602f6870/1752649778/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753836633","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3882840/633083526/387bda4f00f64ff4766f7609180d4b85602f6870/1752649778/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753836633","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3882840/